<section class="ways" id="donate"><div class="wrap">
<h2>Ways to give</h2>
<p class="sub">About $7 covers one mother's kit: iron tablets for her pregnancy, two health guides in her language, and a handwritten card.</p>
<div class="give">
<div class="give-main"><h3>Give online</h3><p>A secure donation page. You can give once or monthly, and 100% of your gift reaches Heartlines International.</p><a class="btn primary" href="{{ site.donateUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Donate online<span class="vh"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a><p class="small">Our 501(c)(3) application is pending with the IRS.</p></div>
<div class="give-other">
<p><strong>Give by check.</strong> Make checks payable to &ldquo;Heartlines International.&rdquo; <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Giving%20by%20check">Email us</a> for the mailing address.</p>
<p><strong>Ask about a match.</strong> Many employers match gifts. Employer matching opens once our 501(c)(3) status is confirmed. <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Employer%20matching">Ask us</a></p>
</div>
</div>
</div></section>

