<p class="date-line">Sunday, November 8 &middot; 4&ndash;8 PM</p>
<p class="sub">Chipotle, 1110 Blossom Hill Rd, Ste 30, San Jose. Chipotle gives 25% of our supporters' sales during the event to Heartlines International. Bring friends, family, your team, your club: every order helps.</p>
<div class="rules">
<div><h3>In the restaurant</h3><p>Before you pay, show the flyer on your phone or tell the cashier you're there for the Heartlines International fundraiser.</p></div>
<div><h3>Order ahead for pickup</h3><p>In the Chipotle app or on chipotle.com, choose <strong>Pickup</strong> at the Blossom Hill Rd restaurant, then enter code <strong>RCTR9LP</strong> under &ldquo;Enter a Promo Code&rdquo; and tap Apply. Pick up between 4 and 8 PM on November 8.</p></div>
<div><h3>What doesn't count</h3><p>Delivery, orders through other apps, orders on other days or at other locations, and buying gift cards. Paying with a gift card you already have is fine.</p></div>
</div>
